# Docs first

Treat documentation as part of the deliverable, not a follow-up.

## When docs must change in the same PR

Update the matching guide when you change any of:

- Plugin `skills/` or `rules/` (behavior, paths, prerequisites)
- `.career-pipeline.yml` schema or example
- `.cursor-plugin/plugin.json` / `plugin.json` / install instructions
- Scripts under skills or repo `scripts/`
- Template folder layout that skills assume

## Where docs live

| Path | Audience |
|------|----------|
| Root `docs/` | Plugin installers and maintainers of this repo |
| `template/docs/` | People using a job-search workspace copied from `template/` |

Do not duplicate long guides in both places. Prefer a canonical page plus a short pointer.

## Voice

Prefer plain, conversational wording. Avoid em dashes and stock AI filler in docs and README copy.
